# needs-you-expiry once a day at 09:17. Install with `crontab -e` as the user who ran the
# needs-you invite installer (~/.config/needs-you/env) and wrote ~/.config/needs-you/expiry.conf.
# cron's PATH is minimal: the poller finds the CLI in ~/.local/bin by itself.
# Errors go to cron mail; the poller always exits 0.
17 9 * * *  $HOME/.local/bin/needs-you-expiry >/dev/null  # needs-you-expiry
